		pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχαιραι κουρίδες</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shears</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομμώτρια</span>
