			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούρισσα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				528.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρίς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωρίς</span>, 
